#ROOMS
#31000
Theed Landing~
Stone docks sit above the lake Solleu. Waterfalls pour from the cliffs
behind the city, and the spray keeps the pale paving dark. Nubian craft
rest on rails over the water. Palace guards in chrome armor walk the
edge, and a freight droid stacks crates of river fish.
~
