#31001
Palace Avenue~
Palace Avenue is wide enough for a procession. The stone is the color of
bone, and pearls from the lake are set in the gutter. People in soft
robes give the center of the street to anyone in a guard's helm. The
falls are a white wall at the end of the view.
~
